      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_04a",
      "hash64": "44B2ED496F004C6A",
      "text": "這麼一來，失去老大的\\n閣道二小隊就會瀕臨瓦解了。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
