    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_04d",
      "hash64": "44B2EA496F004751",
      "text": "這麼一來，失去老大的\\n王良四小隊應該就會消失了……[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
