    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_19",
      "hash64": "4099456F657772B5",
      "text": "……看來我說了些不必要的話。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_20",
      "hash64": "4095C66F65746511",
      "text": "關於約定好的報酬，\\n我把ＬＰ儲值到[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的手機吧。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0009"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "team_0090_system_02",
      "hash64": "CEB959DBE0C2FF1B",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n獲得了１００００ＬＰ！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "team_0090_system_03",
      "hash64": "CEB958DBE0C2FD68",
      "text": "可以用招式學習器機製作的\\n招式學習器種類變多了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "team_0090_cassiopeia_18",
      "hash64": "4099446F65777102",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳好好運用招式學習器吧。\\n剩下的老大也交給[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了。\\r\\n……追加報酬記得跟補給班拿。[VAR 0x0114(0009)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
